+## Persistence rollback
+
+This extraction keeps the existing `documents`, `embeddings`, and `deliveries` tables and
+records unchanged. If persistence work is later started and needs to be rolled back,
+restore the prior implementation behind `Knowledge::Catalog.list`, deploy it while
+retaining those tables and records, and remove the replacement only after the Catalog
+characterization tests pass. No migration or data conversion is part of this change.
